        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Park City, Kansas; Wichita, Kansas\n- Organizations: Wild West World; Wichita Greyhound Park\n- Systems: Interstate 135; Interstate 70; Interstate 35; Kansas Turnpike\n\nFacts:\n- Wild West World was a Wild West theme park in Park City, Kansas.\n- Wild West World opened on May 5, 2007.\n- Wild West World was located on 130 acres along Interstate 135 near Wichita Greyhound Park.\n- Wichita Greyhound Park was Phil Ruffin's park.\n- Wild West World closed on July 9, 2007.\n- Wichita Greyhound Park closed in 2007.\n- Interstate 135 has its northern terminus at its junction with Interstate 70.\n- Interstate 135 has its southern terminus at Interstate 35, the Kansas Turnpike.",
